WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.850
Next up on the news.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:10.400
The Yokohama Detective World Fair, commonly known as Detective Expo, is finally raising its curtains.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.610
Minami Haruko-chan, a talented songstress will be singing the theme song.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:17.490
This will be my debut song.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:22.120
I heard that you are in Yokohama in order to record your promotion video.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.210
The video is slated to be released worldwide.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:28.460
Please don't miss out on it!

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.340
Now for the weather forecast by Konato.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.640
Hey, don't be mischievous.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.450
Have my skills gotten a little rusty?

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:15.420
Now, what will be today's waking up candy?

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.060
It tastes like this, huh?

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:29.190
Well, I'm okay with it.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:36.990
Coming!

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:40.740
Hello.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:43.490
Why are you three boycotting your job!?

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:46.910
All of the paperwork is piling up on me!

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.460
Hurry up and come to work!

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.290
We won't come today.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:52.290
Why not!?

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.380
Because we all applied for a day off.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:55.800
Huh? Day off?

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.680
In other words, paid vacation.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.510
Didn't we submit a written application yesterday?

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:01.600
What are you saying?

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.390
I don't remember approving anything like that!

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:18.900
Has everyone gathered here?

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.110
Yes!

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:24.620
Well then, the lessons at Neo Holmes Detective Academy will start.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:27.120
Yes!

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.120
Today we'll teach about disguises!

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:34.250
It's a <i>very</i>  important technique for a detective.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:37.210
Becoming an electric man...

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.260
Becoming a postal box...

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.760
I'll be teaching you all about it but before I do...

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.510
Please pay your school fees.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:46.970
At the very least, pay us in sweets.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:47.930
Or in potatoes.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.480
Meat will be fine too.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.190
Eh?!?

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:54.230
Thanks a lot. You're welcome.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:57.150
Mori-san is going to do the practical skill lessons, right?

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.740
About her... She is nowhere to be found.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:05.490
She said she had to find something and went off on her own.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.830
I've collected the school fees!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.250
What's the matter? Everyone's waiting.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.710
We have to start soon...

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.920
...or everyone will leave.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.260
We can't let that happen!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:25.010
We have to keep the Holmes Detective Academy going until Henriette-san comes back!

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.850
Yeah. You're right.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.470
Okay!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.690
The four of us will be teaching you all.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:34.400
Pervert!
Disguise!

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:37.780
You're wrong. It's "Disguise", isn't it?

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.110
Oh, you're right.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.440
One more time.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.200
Disguise!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.160
You're wrong again!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.410
I said it properly! I really said "Pervert"!

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.410
You just said your mistake!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.620
Disguise!

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:53.830
A chair...

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.060
We have disguised ourselves as chairs.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:58.880
Hold on... Hold on...

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.300
How's that a disguise?

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.260
Those aren't human chairs!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.680
Those are just stalks!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.310
Let's go home.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.180
Right.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.060
Please stay!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.940
You can go home but I won't return your food.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.820
How pitiable.

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:25.240
How about this?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:32.250
Let me, Akechi Kokoro, genius beautiful girl of the police with an IQ of 14,000,000,000,000,000,000 give you a special training out of kindness?

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.250
Huh? Like I would―

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.620
Kokoro-chan, really!?

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:36.630
Really?

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.380
We want to become great detectives!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:43.130
We will work hard! All in order to become great detectives!

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.220
My my...

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:49.640
I'll use them to trouble those boycotters' holiday.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.060
They didn't get my approval― (I approved them though).

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:53.890
Like I'll let you all take a paid vacation!

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:57.190
A perfect plan that doesn't need me to soil my hands!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.230
But first!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.320
Don't call me Kokoro-chan!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.690
Come again.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:06.740
Egg with honey! You can pour as much honey as you want!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.280
Pao de Castella for your hunger!

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.200
Welcome!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.660
Here you go. Thanks for waiting.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:12.870
Please come again.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:13.910
Weee~

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.000
We'll eat them when we get back home.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:16.540
Yeah!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.290
Oh, welcome.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.750
I see her.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.500
She's taking a paid vacation to do a part time job?

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.510
A government worker doing commerce at a pathway!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.090
Go, my slaves!

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.760
Bon appétit!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.890
I'm sorry about this, Tsugiko-chan. I made you work for me.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.260
It's fine.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:35.020
Anyway, does your back hurt? You've got to get it treated.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.060
Excuse me.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.940
Yes, welcome!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.480
Milky Holmes!?

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:44.070
Give us some miniature Pao de Castella, oh goddess!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.400
Our stomachs are grumbling.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:52.740
I guess I don't have a choice...

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.910
I'm only giving you one each.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.460
Gulp!

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.460
More, please!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.300
That one piece isn't enough!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.380
You're troubling me.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:11.550
This isn't my shop so I can't give you much.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:12.680
Then...

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:17.600
Oh? It's my first time having miniature Pao de Castella.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.440
It's really cute when I look closely!

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:24.860
Who are those girls!?

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:25.980
So disgusting!

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.440
Okay, I get it!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.360
Here, you can drink the dough.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.370
So delicious...

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.660
So much...

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.290
Delicious! One more serving!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.290
My goodness...

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:47.260
This negotiating technique that Akechi-san taught us really brings wonders, doesn't it?

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:50.840
It can make a store work in our favor!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.970
It's so sweet and syrupy! Super tasty!

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:59.100
You drank my next batch of dough too!

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.640
Tsugiko...

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.610
Those stupid Milky Holmes are really useful in these situations.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.820
All right! I'm going all out!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.030
Hello!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.660
We came to trash the dojo!

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.490
Hey, what's with them?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.660
Cordelia-san, the dojo is up to you.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.970
Trash the dojo, I hear?

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:26.170
What's this, Cordelia-san?

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.670
I'm trained in close combat and so...

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.640
It's pitch black.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:43.690
D-D-D-D-D-Dark...

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.060
Scary...

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:48.280
The place stinks of sweat.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:07.630
Kan!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:26.940
Rinshan tsumo, Honitsu, Sanankou, 4 dora, 8 with ura dora.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.480
I've completed my set too.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:35.280
Wow, amazing. You were waiting to make a full Kamaboko set.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.320
She's doubled her score!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.660
You cheated!

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:43.250
No fair! No fair!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.130
Infiltration training is also a success.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.170
Shining~

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.930
Can I really become a great detective?

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.260
Of course.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.140
Has Kokoro-chan ever been wrong before?

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.640
I suppose you have a point.

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:06.310
That was fun.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.310
What should I do next?

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:12.110
Sorry about that.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:16.780
How dare you step on the feet of a genius girl with an IQ of 140,000,000,000,000,000,000,000!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:20.700
"Sorry about that" won't work miracles! I can't believe these guards lately!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.620
I'll show you my wrath!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.960
Hello, this is the traffic police department.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.330
There is a traffic offense!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:31.250
Hamakko Security Illegal Transport Vehicle!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.800
Its location is at the Nekai Building! Come right away!

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:38.140
Hello!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:43.560
Say, can you stop using Milky Holmes to harass people?

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:46.440
You shut the windows, right?

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:50.440
I also have evidence from the security cameras I hacked into.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.860
Dammit. I'm exposed?

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:56.190
With that said, I'm having a day off today.

00:09:56.190 --> 00:10:00.950
We'll only come to work if the Phantom Thief Empire is making a comeback.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.910
The Phantom Thief Empire is no longer present already!

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.160
Any other matters won't do.

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.250
So then, do your job.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:11.750
I see! The Phantom Thief Empire, huh?

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.300
Hey, come over here.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:18.220
Hey, what's this!?

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.300
Get changed already!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.640
Why should we!?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:25.220
Oh jeez, stop whining and get changed!

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:36.070
Aren't we wearing Phantom Thief clothing?

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:38.280
I wanted to be Arsène.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.530
I'm Raccha Mutton-san!

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.410
Why are we in this clothing?

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:48.960
If I make them impersonate the Phantom Thief Empire, I can tear those smirks off their faces!

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:08.680
Why must we dress up as the Phantom Thief Empire!?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:13.520
You need to be able to put yourself in the Phantom Thieves' shoes to be a great detective, right?

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.230
That's why you have to turn into a Phantom Thief!

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.440
I see!

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:19.190
Profound deduction.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.780
I know, right?

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.240
What should I have you to steal?

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.950
But isn't that...

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.030
...theft...

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:27.790
We're doing a video shooting!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.830
I repeat! We're doing a video shooting!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.330
Ah! I see.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.630
A video shooting! Let's do our best!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:34.670
Yeah!

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.960
Eh? The vehicle is gone.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:38.550
Where did it go?

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.670
All right!

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:42.050
Snatch that case away from those idiots!

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.760
Roger that!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.180
We'll become great Phantom Thieves.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:49.350
We'll do our best to steal!

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.020
Let's do it!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:53.520
I'll go along with everyone's opinion.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.020
Everyone don't move!

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.360
If you do, my magnum will go off!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.490
Who are you?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.700
We are...

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.950
I'll let you taste my hot bombs!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.450
Rum-raisin!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.080
Do you know about porn?

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.910
Stone River!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.750
Twwwwwenty!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:17.210
Toys of err... Resplendence!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.920
We are the Phantom Thief Empire!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.590
Phantom Thief Empire!?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.510
Obey us and give us the case!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:25.840
Will this do?

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.050
Okay, don't move.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.140
It was a trick!?

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:33.770
Here you go!

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:39.320
So dark! So scary!!!

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.940
We were had! They used a fake gun!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.400
Hold it right there!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.950
Yeah! They'll be scared stiff and come running to me!

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.870
Work hard to become a Phantom Thief!

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:50.450
What!?

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.000
Kokoro-chan!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.250
What!?

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.420
You are also...

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.130
Don't call me Kokoro-chan!

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:06.180
I came to save you when I thought that you were a Phantom Thief too.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.640
No thanks at all!

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:10.350
I'll use this!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.190
Now my identity won't be exposed.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.980
Return the case!

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.650
This is bad!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.980
Faster, Cordelia.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.870
Jeez, it's all their fault.

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.240
Hold it right there!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.250
That was the Phantom Thief Empire!

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.500
Hold it right there!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.750
Phantom Thief Empire?

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:44.300
Hirano!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:47.430
Come on board!

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:53.390
The Phantom Thief Empire has reappeared... My skills are getting rusty.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.850
Yeah. It has been a long time.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:56.560
Huh?

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:57.140
What?

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:59.940
It's weird considering that they are the Phantom Thief Empire.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:04.940
There is another person with the head of a cabbage.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:05.690
Who's that?

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:06.860
Dunno...

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:09.820
Save me...

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:12.200
Huh? I heard something from the case.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.160
Oh no, a dead end!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:15.790
They are going to catch up to us.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:19.960
That way!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:21.500
Cordelia!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:25.380
Cordeliaaaa!

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.340
Hello, I'm Touyama Saku.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.680
Hello, Touyama Saku-san.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:41.100
So, Touyama-san, can we hear about your reason for joining this discussion?

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:45.400
When I was fighting with the Phantom Thieves, my sweet was stolen and it made me immobile.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.780
I see.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:50.030
That's why you want to kick your sweet tooth.

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.950
But you are sucking on a sweet right now.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:58.290
This is an electric sweet that was made
by a mad scientist I met on facefuuk.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.170
Amazing...

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.040
Wonderful...

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.540
I envy you.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.310
Oh? Tsugiko? Hirano?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.430
Saku!?

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.180
What are you doing out here?

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.850
Good timing!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.230
Tell me where I can control this ship!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.650
Akechi, do you have a boater's license!?

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:29.990
I'm a genius beautiful girl of the police, so I don't need that!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.200
My me...

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.120
You're fine.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.490
Let me out of here. Let me out of here.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:39.140
This is...

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:42.370
Cases can speak nowadays.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.830
Hold it right there!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.960
Leave it to us!

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.920
We'll take back the stolen goods!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.050
You are...

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.510
We're the Yokohama Police, G3.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:56.810
Police...

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.680
That's who we are.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.980
*Shock*

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:07.360
They are from the Shimei Exile Gang.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.020
Here.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:14.360
It's a complete match.

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.990
What!?

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:17.120
Hey, you guys!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:17.830
Hey!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.410
Stay right there!

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.380
It seems we shook them off.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.000
We can rest now.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.550
Steer away!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.860
Owww...

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.110
Is everyone fine?

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:52.530
Yes... Where are we?

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:57.740
It seems to be the opening place of the Detective International Expo.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:01.540
Jeez! I'm all exhausted from acting like a Phantom Thief.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:12.960
Hello! I'm Minami Haruko!

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.630
Umm... Who are you?

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.090
Like I said, Minami Haruko.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.470
Haruko-sensei, are you fine!?

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:22.140
Oh my, Manager. You're a bit late.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.980
I was worried about you, Haruko-sensei.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.310
Hey!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.900
Thanks for the help, Milky Holmes!

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:34.900
Those badass criminals were trying to kidnap Minami Haruko-chan.

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.910
You got us there.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.740
Why are you wearing Phantom Thief clothing?

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.700
Then we...

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:45.410
...did something that detectives would do once in a while.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.210
Forgot about that and get this thing off me!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.380
Stop slacking around!

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:55.800
Congratulations to Milky Holmes.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:00.010
Without further ado, let's start!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:03.100
I'm glad everyone's okay.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.430
World treasure!

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:05.600
She's a newcomer, though.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:14.320
Welcome to the spectacular Detective World Fair!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:22.700
Shall we walk down the park in Yokohama?

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.200
Oh Yokohama, Yokohama! The streets are overflowing with love

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.410
What's that?

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:29.500
She said that she'd do anything for us.

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:30.750
That's why we told her to do this.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.590
Everyone in the world...

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:38.130
If we star in the video, I'm sure Henriette-san will be watching it somewhere in the world.
Everyone in the world...

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.380
Everyone in the world...

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:39.430
Shall we walk together hand in hand?

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:41.680
My impression of them has changed.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:47.890
Shall we walk together hand in hand?

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:51.150
The place that tickles the tip of your nose... surely is Chinatown

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:54.570
Hey, why are you deciding everything by yourselves!?

00:18:56.150 --> 00:19:04.580
We've seen everything to our hearts' content. Shall we set off?

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:12.960
Oh Yokohama, Yokohama. The streets bring smiles to everyone.

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.630
It's time for me to take this item now.

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:29.430
As I thought, nothing will happen with only myself.

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:33.150
I need the power of the descendant of the Detective Holmes.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.190
Grin.
Shall we move on?

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:41.280
Shall we move on?

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:43.410
Grin~

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:51.580
It's almost time for the Great International Detective Fair, or in short Detective Fair, to start.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:52.920
I'm so looking forward to it.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:58.300
But before that, I need to settle my stuff with Milky Holmes.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.170
I won't lose to Sherlock's Baritsu.

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:03.800
I'll be waiting at the Yokohama Pasta!

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:08.220
Next week, Mori Arty's chance to collect free things!

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:11.060
The culprit is... me!

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:13.100
Let's do it!
